# Official TMLR stylefile bundle, redistributed byte-for-byte from
# https://github.com/JmlrOrg/tmlr-style-file at 7bf90ef.  Upstream ships
# trailing whitespace on comment lines.  TMLR states that changes to the
# stylefile "may result in rejection without review", so these bytes must not be
# touched; disabling the whitespace check for exactly these three paths lets
# `git diff --check` report real defects in our own sources without flagging
# upstream's.  Only the `whitespace` attribute is unset: no `text` or `eol`
# attribute is set here, so Git never rewrites these files.
paper/tmlr_style/tmlr.sty      -whitespace
paper/tmlr_style/tmlr.bst      -whitespace
paper/tmlr_style/fancyhdr.sty  -whitespace

# Vendored third-party LaTeX packages and their licence texts, redistributed
# byte-for-byte under GPL v3 and LPPL; see paper/texmf_vendor/VENDORED-PACKAGES.md.
# Upstream ships trailing whitespace, and these bytes are held to pinned
# SHA-256 digests that the build enforces, so they must not be rewritten to
# satisfy a lint.  As above, only the `whitespace` attribute is unset: no `text`
# or `eol` attribute is set, so Git never rewrites them.
